#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.ffill.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.ffill"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ffill:1 of
msgid "Forward-fill within each group."
msgstr "在每个组内进行前向填充。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ffill:3 of
msgid ""
"Propagate the last non-null value forward across consecutive nulls, "
"scoped per group.  ``limit`` caps consecutive fills per run (``None`` = "
"unlimited); ``limit <= 0`` raises ``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"在每组范围内，将最后一个非空值向前传播以填充连续的空值。``limit`` 限制"
"每次运行中连续填充的数量（``None`` = 无限制）；当 ``limit <= 0`` 时抛出 `"
"`ValueError``。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.ffill.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ffill:7 of
msgid "Maximum number of consecutive nulls to fill in each run."
msgstr "每次运行中要填充的最大连续空值数量。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ffill:9 of
msgid "Column(s) to fill.  If None, all non-group-key columns are filled."
msgstr "要填充的列。如果为 None，则填充所有非分组键列。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.ffill.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ffill:12 of
msgid ""
"Forward-filled LiteFrame with the same shape (row count preserved).  "
"Output dtypes equal the input dtypes."
msgstr ""
"具有相同形状的前向填充 LiteFrame（保留行数）。输出数据类型与输入数据类型"
"相同。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.ffill.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ffill:17 of
msgid "备注"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ffill:19 of
msgid ""
"Grouped transforms hash-shuffle rows by group key, so the output row "
"order follows reducer/hash-partition order and is **not** aligned with "
"the input frame (unlike pandas).  Row count is preserved.  Intra-group "
"row order *is* preserved (the hash shuffle is stable w.r.t. intra-group "
"order), so the per-group fill direction follows the original input order."
"  See ``docs/designs/liteframe/operators/window.md``."
msgstr ""
"分组转换通过分组键对行进行哈希洗牌，因此输出行顺序遵循 reducer/哈希分区"
"顺序，并且与输入框架**不**对齐（与 pandas 不同）。保留行数。组内行顺序*是"
"*保留的（哈希洗牌相对于组内顺序是稳定的），因此每组的填充方向遵循原始输入"
"顺序。参见 ``docs/designs/liteframe/operators/window.md``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ffill:27 of
msgid ""
"Null-key rows are preserved with a null result (matching pandas "
"``groupby.ffill()`` under the default ``dropna=True``); they are not "
"grouped together."
msgstr ""
"空键行以空结果保留（匹配 pandas 在默认 ``dropna=True`` 下的 ``groupby."
"ffill()``）；它们不会被分组在一起。"

